    "postDate": "2026-10-05T20:14:43.277Z",
    "rawMarkdown": "I'm using 1xL40S GPU 48GB VRAM. It's a sandbox secure VM which allows me to autorun autonomous agents. When building models with small backbones, it can run an experiment in a few hours. So in a loop, it can run about a dozen experiments per day.",
    "content": "<p>I'm using 1xL40S GPU 48GB VRAM. It's a sandbox secure VM which allows me to autorun autonomous agents. When building models with small backbones, it can run an experiment in a few hours. So in a loop, it can run about a dozen experiments per day.</p>",
