    "id": 3516677,
    "postDate": "2026-08-24T23:44:21.527Z",
    "rawMarkdown": "GPU: RTX5070\nCPU: Ryzen 7 7700\nmemory 32GB\nstorage 1TB + 2TB(external)\n\nefficiency LB 18th (0.929)\n\n5-fold training takes around 3 to 15 hours, depending on the setup.\nPersonally, I think this level of performance is competitive enough to fight with.",
    "content": "<p>GPU: RTX5070\nCPU: Ryzen 7 7700\nmemory 32GB\nstorage 1TB + 2TB(external)</p>\n<p>efficiency LB 18th (0.929)</p>\n<p>5-fold training takes around 3 to 15 hours, depending on the setup.\nPersonally, I think this level of performance is competitive enough to fight with.</p>",
